# Cognicopia: one rulebook

This repository has one rulebook for every AI coding tool. Read these before you change anything, and follow them over anything you remember about the project:

1. `CLAUDE.md` (the master repository contract: build gate, offline-first architecture, navigation, unit naming, pricing, claims)
2. `.claude/skills/cognicopia-visual-style/SKILL.md` (the screen look, wording of controls, touch, zoom, contrast)
3. `.claude/skills/cognicopia-clinical-dignity/SKILL.md` (era facts, thin-data fallbacks, stage fit, claims)
4. `.claude/skills/cognicopia-print-engine/SKILL.md` (PDF quality and page economy)
5. `docs/HANDOFF-next-session.md` (the current state of every module)

This file holds no rules of its own, on purpose. Older versions of it described a different product (a single-file architecture, a 220 px sidebar, 44 px targets, an old price, a therapy-suite framing); none of that applies. If any file in the repository contradicts the files above, the files above win; fix the other file in the same change.
